Take a look at {{SupportCaseUpdateEventListener}} on how to update webview with MQTT event:

# {{await this.supportCaseMessageService.addClientMessage(ctx, event.support_case_id, event.event_created);}}
# {{await this.supportCaseMessageService.addClientMessageChanged(ctx, event.support_case_id, event.event_created);}}

{{addClientMessage}} – marks the case as unread and sends a "ping" to the webview to refresh it; this assumes a new message visible to the user was added to the chat. If no new message was added, using this method will cause an issue where the case cannot be marked as read.

{{addClientMessageChanged}} – only sends a "ping" to the webview without marking the case as unread; used when something changes in user-facing messages but no new message is produced. This should be used when an existing message is edited.

